{"id":"admirador","lemma":"admirador","pos":"adj","rank":4060,"glosses":["admiring"],"ipa":"/admiɾaˈdoɾ/","forms":{"feminine":"admiradora","masculinePlural":"admiradores","femininePlural":"admiradoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-admirador.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tenés un admirador secreto.","en":"You have a secret admirer.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"a secret"}]},{"text":"Cientos de admiradores están esperando a la cantante.","en":"Hundreds of fans are waiting for the singer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693076","words":[{"g":"hundred","l":"ciento"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"who sings, singing"}]},{"text":"Tom tiene un admirador secreto.","en":"Tom has a secret admirer.","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"a secret"}]},{"text":"Tom no sabía que tenía una admiradora secreta.","en":"Tom didn't know that he had a secret admirer.","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"a secret","l":"secreto"}]},{"text":"Soy un gran admirador de la cultura americana.","en":"I am a great admirer of American culture.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"culture"},{"g":"a cloth jacket with…"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]}]}